Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://git.leicraftmc.de/LeiOS/Theme-Packages/Plymouth-Theme
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: leios.theme.plymouth-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plymouth
Recommends: initramfs-tools
Description: LeiOS Plymouth boot theme
 This package provides the LeiOS theme for the Plymouth boot splash.
 .
 It includes the theme description, background image, logo and a blurred
 bottom panel for readable startup logs. On installation the theme is set
 as the Plymouth default in /usr/share/plymouth/plymouthd.defaults and the
 initramfs is rebuilt.
